## Data Availability

#### Data Availability Table
| Test Type | Data Source | Environment | Data Type | Data Volume | Comments |
|-----------|-------------|-------------|-----------|-------------|----------|
| Automation, Functional | Mock Jira API, Real Jira API | QA, Dev | Auth tokens, Issue payloads | Low | Simulate 401, 403, 404, missing desc |

---

## 4.6 Test Environments
- Integration or staging environment with controlled access to Jira API endpoints
- Mock Jira service or API simulator capable of returning 200, 401, 403, 404, and empty-description payloads
- Credential matrix covering valid user, invalid token, expired token, and insufficient-permission scenarios
- Test data set containing issues with accessible descriptions, missing descriptions, and inaccessible descriptions
- Centralized logging/trace capture to verify unauthorized responses are surfaced without downstream requirement parsing
- Workflow control harness to validate Human-in-the-Loop Gate 2 pause/resume behavior

---

## 6. Test Schedule / Milestone
- Test design and scripting: 2 days
- Environment setup and data prep: 1 day
- Execution window: 2 days
- Results analysis and reporting: 1 day
- Core resources: 1 QA automation engineer, 1 test lead, 1 DevOps support

---

## 7. Assumptions
- Jira API endpoint is reachable from test environments
- Mock service can simulate all required error states
- Credentials for all test cases are available
- Human-in-the-Loop Gate 2 approval will be provided in a timely manner

---

## 9. Risk Mitigation Table
| Risk ID | Description | Impact | Likelihood | Severity | Mitigation Action | Owner |
|---------|-------------|--------|------------|----------|-------------------|-------|
| R1 | Jira API authentication failures (401/403) | High | Medium | High | Pre-validate all credentials; use mock API for negative cases | QA Lead |
| R2 | Missing or inaccessible issue descriptions | Medium | High | Medium | Ensure error handling logic is robust; log all failures | QA Engineer |
| R3 | Test data setup delays | Medium | Medium | Medium | Prepare test data in advance; use mock payloads if needed | Test Lead |
| R4 | Human-in-the-Loop approval latency | Low | Medium | Low | Notify stakeholders early; set approval SLAs | Project Manager |

